who found the next Mozart.

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:20.843
Do you know what I mean?

00:06:20.843 --> 00:06:24.324
Oh, I'm the one who saw it, and
I'm the one who fostered it.

00:06:24.324 --> 00:06:27.090
And, yeah, everybody's playing

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.980
